---
interface Props { verified: string; }
const { verified } = Astro.props;
---
<aside class="not-prose mt-6 rounded-xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-surface p-5" aria-label="How this guide was researched">
  <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">How this guide was researched</p>
  <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
    <li>Manufacturer documentation and spec sheets reviewed</li>
    <li>NEC, NFPA, EPA, and CPSC sources cross-checked where they govern</li>
    <li>Specifications verified: {verified}</li>
    <li>Prices are planning context, never quotes</li>
    <li>No manufacturer paid for placement or conclusions</li>
    <li>Installation guidance never substitutes a licensed pro</li>
  </ul>
  <a href="/editorial-policy/" class="mt-2 inline-flex min-h-[32px] items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary underline decoration-accent underline-offset-4">Corrections policy →</a>
</aside>
